{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"SystemProfile","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7Systems13SystemProfileV","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Profiling.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Profiling.swift#L77"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemTiming"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Profiling","title":"Profiling"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SystemProfile"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Insert a profile into a world to find out where a schedule spends its time. Every schedule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that runs on the world then records each system’s runs in it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.resources.insert(SystemProfile())","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 100), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: 0))","","let frame = Schedule {","    Gravity()","    Movement().after(Gravity.self)","}","frame.run(on: &world)","frame.run(on: &world)","","let timings = world.resources[SystemProfile.self].timings","print(timings.map(\\.name))","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Gravity\", \"Movement\"]\"","print(timings.map(\\.runs))","\/\/ Prints \"[2, 2]\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemTiming","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" also holds the total, average, longest and latest time of the system’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A run’s time covers the system’s own work, measured on a continuous clock: not its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conditions, nor the commands it queued, which apply after its wave. A system its conditions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skip doesn’t run, so nothing is recorded for it. Systems in the same wave run at the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time, so their times can add up to more than the wave took. Insert a new profile to start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A resource that records how long each system takes to run.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/systemprofile"]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/timings"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Resource":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/resource","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Resource"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Resource"}],"title":"Resource","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that a world can hold a single value of, outside any entity."}]},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/SystemProfile/timings":{"title":"timings","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SystemTiming","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems12SystemTimingV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The timing of each system that has run, in the order the systems first ran."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/timings","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/systemprofile\/timings","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/SystemProfile/init()":{"title":"init()","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"url":"\/documentation\/systems\/systemprofile\/init()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile\/init()","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates an empty profile."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Systems/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://Systems/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/SystemTiming":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SystemTiming","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The times one system of a schedule has taken to run."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemTiming","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SystemTiming","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SystemTiming","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/systemtiming"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems/SystemProfile":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemProfile","title":"SystemProfile","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A resource that records how long each system takes to run.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SystemProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/systems\/systemprofile"},"doc://Systems/documentation/Systems":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare the rules of a simulation as systems, and run them on a world in a schedule."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems","title":"Systems","url":"\/documentation\/systems"}}}